"t": "take it out before it's gone", "red": true}, {"a": 1609, "n": 114, "t": "Everyone around him said the same thing."}, {"a": 1729, "n": 114, "t": "So he put the phone down. And left it."}, {"a": 1939, "n": 114, "t": "Every paycheck, a little more."}, {"a": 2059, "n": 114, "t": "He stopped looking."}, {"a": 2179, "n": 129, "t": "check it. just once.", "red": true}, {"a": 2314, "n": 99, "t": "He didn't."}, {"a": 2419, "n": 114, "t": "It had grown while he wasn't watching."}, {"a": 2539, "n": 114, "t": "Then another drop. A bigger one."}, {"a": 2659, "n": 129, "t": "this time it's over", "red": true}, {"a": 2794, "n": 114, "t": "He had heard that voice before."}, {"a": 2914, "n": 99, "t": "It came back."}, {"a": 3019, "n": 84, "t": "...", "red": true, "at": "mid"}, {"a": 3109, "n": 129, "t": "Year twenty. He finally looked."}, {"a": 3244, "n": 129, "t": "Most of it grew while he was busy living."}, {"a": 3379, "n": 129, "t": "Every fortune on this channel took time.", "at": "mid"}, {"a": 3514, "n": 114, "t": "Most of it was waiting.", "at": "mid"}], "cards": [{"a": 1845, "n": 90, "big": "YEAR 1."}, {"a": 3630, "n": 255, "big": "WAIT.", "line": "Slow money is still money.", "cmd": "Stop checking."}], "day": [{"a": 1935, "n": 120, "t": "YEAR 1"}, {"a": 2055, "n": 120, "t": "YEAR 2"}, {"a": 2175, "n": 240, "t": "YEAR 3"}, {"a": 2415, "n": 120, "t": "YEAR 5"}, {"a": 2535, "n": 375, "t": "YEAR 6"}, {"a": 2910, "n": 105, "t": "YEAR 8"}, {"a": 3105, "n": 135, "t": "YEAR 20"}], "hud": [{"a": 1935, "n": 120, "label": "PUT AWAY", "from": 0, "to": 260, "unit": " $"}]}}, "split": [0, 387, 537, 708, 878, 1051, 1192, 1334, 1482, 1623, 1767, 2019, 2206, 2348, 2494, 2666, 2808, 2952, 3182, 3367, 3885]}